stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> Stage: local copy is Ahead
    Stage --> VerifyTmp: write current.tmp-HOST/
    VerifyTmp --> Abort: re-read hash != L
    VerifyTmp --> Rename: re-read hash == L
    Abort --> [*]: remove tmp, log ERROR
    Rename --> Publish: rename to current/
    Publish --> ReadTree: current.json written last,<br/>sync client delivers to other hosts
    ReadTree --> InFlight: tree hash != current.json hash
    ReadTree --> Usable: tree hash == current.json hash
    InFlight --> ReadTree: retry next tick, apply nothing
    Usable --> [*]: continue with ADR 0005
